{{Card Infobox|Cost=5|Rarity=Legendary|Type=Building|ReleaseDate=13 March 2023}}
{{Quote|Building that spawns Spear Goblins. Don't look inside... You don't want to see how they're made.}}

The Party Hut was a temporary {{Rarity|Legendary}} [[Cards|card]], only available in a 1 week Challenge. It spawned a single-target, air-targeting, very long-ranged, [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] with moderate hitpoints and low damage. When defeated, it also spawned 3 [[Goblins]], 3 [[Spear Goblins]], and a [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]]. A Party Hut card costs 5 [[Elixir]] to deploy. 

==Strategy ==
*Unlike the [[X-Bow]], the Party Hut cannot attack the tower unit unless it is exactly faced towards the tower unit when it is installed under one river. So, the range is slightly shorter than that of the X-Bow.
*The [[Bowler]] is an effective counter to the Party Hut. His high hitpoints allows him to survive its attacks, and his piercing attack will not only destroy the Party Hut but also immediately defeat the spawned [[Goblins]] and [[Spear Goblins]], as well as dealing decent damage to the [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]]. While this is only a neutral [[Elixir]] trade, it will set up the player for a counterattack. The [[Executioner]] and the [[Bomber/Evolution|Evolved Bomber]] can also work in a similar way.

